Developing the backend and mathematical models for Game in the Box solutions, including implementation of game logic, computational systems, and integration with other system components;
Maintaining and developing game designs used in projects;
Implementing new game-related functionalities;
Preparing and executing unit and integration tests;
Designing game functionalities in accordance with licensing regulations;
Designing and developing game mechanics and game projects supporting ongoing initiatives;
Creating project and technical documentation;
Collaborating with project teams and developers on the integration and implementation of game projects;
Conceptualising and implementing new game projects within defined requirements and constraints;
