2–3 years of commercial backend development experience (e.g. Java/Kotlin/TypeScript/Node.js or C#)
Strong mathematical skills, including a solid understanding of probability, statistics, and algorithms
Mathematical intuition and the ability to build, run, and interpret simulation results
Hands-on experience with unit and integration testing
Strong collaboration skills and experience working in agile, cross-functional teams
Good command of English (written and spoken)
Genuine passion for games and commitment to delivering high-quality software

Nice to have:

Experience with backend development for online casino / iGaming products
Familiarity with video slot mechanics and slot math models (RTP, volatility, hit frequency, pay tables)
Experience designing game mechanics or mathematical models for games
Ability to test and validate mathematical outcomes using MS Excel, programming, and proprietary tools to guarantee accuracy and quality
Understanding of Docker and containerization
Understanding of licensing and regulatory requirements in regulated gaming markets
